CHAPTER II

PRINCIPLES AND OBJECTIVES

Article 2

Protection of women victims of violence shall be conducted based on the principles of:  a. respect for the rights of victims;
b. justice and gender equality;
c. protection of victims;
d. best interests of victims; and  e. non-discrimination.

