translated_text:
Article 3

Protection of women and children victims of violence aims to:  a. prevent all forms of violence against women and children that occur within the household and/or community;
b. protect and provide security for women and children;
c. provide legal assistance;
d. provide services to women and children -8- victims of violence, reporters and witnesses;
e. pursue recovery and social reintegration; and f. increase community participation.

